<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1">Hi PATRIO GABRIEL,<br><br>Your registration is a success! However, this is just the first step to the whole application process.<br><br>

	The application to the 2024 DOST-SEI Undergraduate Scholarship Program is divided into four (4) steps:<br>
	<ul>
	<li>Step 1: Registration</li>
	<li>Step 2: Eligibility Check
	</li>
	<li>Step 3: Filling-out of Application Form  and Uploading of Documentary Requirements
	<ul>
	<li>3.1 Student Information Questionnaire</li>
	<li>3.2: Personal Data</li>
	<li>3.3: Contact Information</li>
	<li>3.4: Family Data</li>
	<li>3.5: Financial Contribution</li>
	<li>3.6: Household Information questionnaire</li>
	<li>3.7: School Information</li>
	<li>3.8: Uploading of Documentary Requirements</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Step 4: Selection of Test Center Location</li>
	</ul>
	<br>
	Failure to complete these steps means an unsuccessful application.
	<br>
	Incomplete submission of application means unsuccessful application to the scholarship.
	<br><br>
	To begin Step 2, please use this link: <br><br>
	<b><a href="https://ugrad.science-scholarships.ph/#/questionnaire/vxgoHxbc">https://ugrad.science-scholarships.ph/#/questionnaire/vxgoHxbc</a></b><br><br><br><br><br>Regards, <br> Administrator<br><br>(This is a system generated message)

